{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0313_1000_p", "source_sha256": "1796d54cf31b5854000ba7c5ba7e63795115bbde49bbd0481913db8494f6f24c", "ja": "（アイドル達が、VRのゲーム内でライブをする事に。\n宣伝のため、星梨花といろいろな場所を巡っている）", "zh": "（偶像们要在VR游戏中举办演唱会。为了宣传，正和星梨花一起到处逛逛。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0313_1001_022ser", "source_sha256": "6f1ddd86a8e07a71457c496cde922deebca1c3c014dc8cebfdfadd87e11c29b8", "ja": "わぁ……！　こんな森もあるんですね！\n絵本で見た、おとぎ話の森みたいです♪", "zh": "哇……！原来还有这样的森林啊！\n简直就像绘本里看到的童话森林一样♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0313_1002_022ser", "source_sha256": "78c978cc42a80fd13bd2817800a9b8fb971aab02bcbcbcab50561fc9ece39ced", "ja": "ちょっとだけ、怖い感じもしますけど……。\nでも、行ってみたいです。これが冒険なんですね♪", "zh": "虽然感觉有一点点可怕……不过，我还是想去看看。这就是冒险吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0313_1003_022ser", "source_sha256": "c4e3138eaafa42b3094b8896eb276b9c6d7d2fa9f404888fb442c1bd5058fcd1", "ja": "翼さんと一緒のゲームだと空も飛べて、\n大きな森もひとっ飛びなんですよ。すごいです！", "zh": "和翼一起玩的游戏里还能飞上天空，一下子就能飞越大片森林呢，好厉害！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0313_1004_022ser", "source_sha256": "aaaed3e7d6c429efdbcec20b4bef4e4f0439046f6ca4a48a680c38b314d73b00", "ja": "ジュニオールみたいなお友達もできたんです。\n小さい竜の子なんですけど、すっかり仲良しで……♪", "zh": "还交到了像朱尼奥尔一样的朋友呢。它是一只小龙宝宝，我们已经成了很要好的朋友……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0313_1005_p", "source_sha256": "06453330c8fcd654a2f07a119a36ee88c71c9b6331cbd6850882c79fcc7ebcc5", "ja": "へえ、そういうこともできるのか！\n本当にすごいんだな、このゲーム。", "zh": "诶，这游戏还能做到这种事啊！\n真的很厉害呢，这个游戏。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0313_1006_022ser", "source_sha256": "730dfb45d43f41a1be6279914be602d0f889f88c3fe657be89a9b23bd472fd37", "ja": "はい！　素敵な出会いや、思いがけないこと、\nドキドキすることが本当にたくさんあるんです。", "zh": "是的！这里真的有好多美好的邂逅、意想不到的事情，还有让人心跳加速的体验。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0313_1007_022ser", "source_sha256": "c23e498fe431a13c180beb89fa05b93c2baf7ce99018c35f3a231d8fc62b6007", "ja": "ゲームの世界は、誰かが作ったものみたいですけど。\nでも、この気持ちは本物だと思います！", "zh": "游戏世界好像是由某个人创造出来的。不过，我觉得这份心情是真实的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0313_1008_p", "source_sha256": "38caf2dca614db54c034827abc47e679f92a0269e3a0118a29736ccd555cd954", "ja": "……そうだな。たとえここが現実じゃない世界だと\nしても、心に感じたことは全部、現実と同じだよ。", "zh": "……说得也是。就算这里并不是现实世界，\n心中感受到的一切，也全都和现实是一样的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0313_1009_p", "source_sha256": "0acd00c9e979a3b503cb86c833d2e3c6af30391ddc46250e005694d83834e212", "ja": "だから今は、もっとこの世界のすみずみまで行って、\n星梨花たちのことも知ってもらおう！", "zh": "所以现在，就更深入这个世界的每个角落，让大家也了解星梨花她们吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0313_1010_p", "source_sha256": "da28c5e6c5bd9968df1254849a669e408d50c1846365ed319471a35a83de434b", "ja": "というわけで、次はどこへ向かおうかな？", "zh": "那么接下来该去哪里呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0313_1011_022ser", "source_sha256": "4d621f9ba135b5a92ba8a0713022c48081fa1bab6d924726c248e53ec925ddfc", "ja": "あっ！　それならここからの案内は、\nわたしに任せてください！", "zh": "啊！既然这样，接下来的带路工作就交给我吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0313_1012_022ser", "source_sha256": "1267a8e160bdd4ddf5eb2375a214d339f47e78a21e3e86d23258aa574339ba1b", "ja": "ゲームの中では{$P$}さんよりも、\nわたしのほうが少しだけ先輩ですから！　えへへっ♪", "zh": "在游戏里，我比{$P$}先生稍微资深一点，所以接下来的引导就交给我吧！嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0313_1013_p", "source_sha256": "bf28ce4d8923113559a1d5da2495c66f13d12da30d051f1fda5729e478f11cff", "ja": "うん、その通りだ。\nよし、星梨花さん、ここはお願いします！", "zh": "嗯，你说得没错。\n好，星梨花，这里就拜托你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0313_1014_022ser", "source_sha256": "589d6a0a442418210e8a18ad236a3f35f998a57392f8e26d3163595087de636c", "ja": "わかりました♪　それじゃ、まず……あっちに\n行ってみましょう、{$P$}さん！", "zh": "好的♪　那么，首先……先去那边\n看看吧，{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
